\b\f0\fs32\lang1038 Inventory Controller & Examine Controller:\par
\b0\fs22 Inventory Controller and examine controller  is very simple to use just use the scene "NextScene" and there by default you get an inventory UI (you can build your own inventory UI if you want), and set the object you want to put in your inventory as "Examine" layer and tag. Then click on the Main Camera there you see a "Examine Raycast" script and just set the "Layer mask Interact" to "Examine".\par
\par
\b\fs32 Drag & Drop:\par
\b0\fs22 Drag and drop system is similar to examine controller and inventory controller just use the "NextSene" and just set the object you want to drag and and drop as "Drag" layer and tag. Then clicl on the Main Camera there you see a "Drag And Drop Raycast" script  and just set the "Layer mask Interact" to "Drag".\par
